_TW": "喬恩，你來得正好，剛好可以目睹氣圓使者決鬥的風采！<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/09/19]" }, "autoContinue": false, "type": "SHOW_MSG", "person": { "person": "antagonists.fancyguy", "expression": "DEFAULT" } }, { "message": { "en_US": "We're about to start our duel!", "langUid": 603, "zh_CN": "我们正要开始我们之间的第三次决斗！<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "ko_KR": "이제 세 번째 결투를 시작하려고 하거든!<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "ja_JP": "これから3度目の決闘を\nはじめるのさ！<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "de_DE": "Wir sind gerade dabei, unser drittes Duell auszutragen!", "zh_TW": "我們正要開始我們之間的第三次決鬥！<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]" }, "autoContinue": false, "type": "SHOW_MSG", "person": { "person": "antagonists.fancyguy", "expression": "CONTENT" } }, { "message": { "en_US": "Well, whoop-de-doo.", "langUid": 604, "zh_CN": "好吧，开始吧。<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "ko_KR": "요란스럽긴.<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "ja_JP": "やれやれ、\nそいつはすごいな。<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "de_DE": "Na großartig!", "zh_TW": "好吧，開始吧。<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]" }, "autoContinue": false, "type": "SHOW_MSG", "person": { "person": "antagonists.sidekick", "expression": "SARCASTIC" } }, { "message": { "en_US": "Didn't we want to start exploring Gaia's Garden today?", "langUid": 605, "zh_CN": "我们今天不是要去探索盖亚花园吗？<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "ko_KR": "오늘 가이아의 정원 탐험하기로 한 거 아니었어?<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "ja_JP": "今日はガイアの園の探索を\nするんじゃなかったのか？<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "de_DE": "Ich dachte, wir wollten heute Gaias Garten erkunden?", "zh_TW": "我們今天不是要去探索蓋亞花園嗎？<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]" }, "autoContinue": false, "type": "SHOW_MSG", "person": { "person": "antagonists.sidekick", "expression": "TOWARD" } }, { "message": { "en_US": "Yes! Right after the duel! It won't take that long.", "langUid": 606, "zh_CN": "是的！但是先等我决斗完！用不了多久的。<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "ko_KR": "그렇지! 이 결투가 끝나고 나면 말이야! 오래 걸리진 않을 거야.<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "ja_JP": "するとも！決闘のあとにな！\nそう時間はかからないさ。<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]", "de_DE": "Ja! Gleich nach dem Duell! Wird nicht lange dauern.", "zh_TW": "是的！但是先等我決鬥完！用不了多久的。<<A<<[CHANGED 2018/03/14]" },